msgstr "[_MT_] {i}Haha... Tak to nazwałem!{/i}"

# game/UpdateScript0.08_2.rpy:6320 #-#-# translate crowdin weekend_date_shopping_4a01044b:
msgid "[_M_] Came to visit your new girlfriend again I see!"
