# game/UpdateScript0.08_2.rpy:6395 #-#-# translate crowdin weekend_date_shopping_74f2bb5a_1:
msgid "[_X_] We usually ask you to make sure your kids are dressed appropriately here, but I'll let it slide since those are really nice jeans."
