# game/UpdateScript0.08_2.rpy:10501 #-#-# translate crowdin sushi_date_joey_0b1896e7:
msgid "[_J_] And not the kind of money you have to pay back, just an agreement to share in future profits, or even come to an agreement to forgive certain debts."
